WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.735
Transitions

00:00:02.115 --> 00:00:05.200
Name the logic first. Then pick the word.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.491
How to spot it

00:00:07.891 --> 00:00:10.025
A blank at the start of a sentence

00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:11.867
Four linking words

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:16.043
It’s testing: the logic between two sentences

00:00:17.243 --> 00:00:18.009
The method

00:00:18.409 --> 00:00:20.708
Step 1: Cover the choices

00:00:20.988 --> 00:00:22.349
They’re built to tempt you.

00:00:22.899 --> 00:00:25.528
Step 2: Read both sentences

00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:28.288
The one before the blank and the one with it.

00:00:28.838 --> 00:00:31.625
Step 3: Name the relationship

00:00:31.905 --> 00:00:35.294
Contrast, result, example, more of the same, or time?

00:00:35.844 --> 00:00:38.704
Step 4: Cross out the wrong groups

00:00:38.984 --> 00:00:41.042
Keep the word whose logic fits.

00:00:41.592 --> 00:00:42.687
In a few words

00:00:42.837 --> 00:00:45.426
Cover. Name. Cross out.

00:00:46.626 --> 00:00:47.591
Word groups

00:00:47.991 --> 00:00:48.901
Contrast

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:52.414
however, but, yet, by contrast, on the other hand

00:00:52.964 --> 00:00:53.863
True anyway

00:00:54.143 --> 00:00:56.896
nevertheless, still, even so, regardless

00:00:57.446 --> 00:00:58.212
Adding on

00:00:58.492 --> 00:01:01.139
moreover, furthermore, in addition, also

00:01:01.689 --> 00:01:02.387
Result

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:05.510
therefore, thus, as a result, consequently

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:06.891
Example

00:01:07.171 --> 00:01:09.651
for example, for instance, specifically

00:01:10.201 --> 00:01:11.102
Replacing

00:01:11.382 --> 00:01:12.502
instead, rather

00:01:13.052 --> 00:01:13.985
Same again

00:01:14.265 --> 00:01:15.785
similarly, likewise

00:01:16.335 --> 00:01:17.163
Rewording

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:18.962
that is, in other words

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:20.328
Time order

00:01:20.608 --> 00:01:23.555
then, later, previously, finally, meanwhile

00:01:24.755 --> 00:01:25.816
Let’s try one

00:01:26.216 --> 00:01:31.656
Most desert plants store water in thick, waxy leaves that slow evaporation.

00:01:31.656 --> 00:01:37.919
The ocotillo of the Sonoran Desert, ______, drops its leaves entirely during dry spells and grows

00:01:37.919 --> 00:01:40.145
new ones within days of a rainstorm.

00:01:40.795 --> 00:01:43.152
Most desert plants store water.

00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:48.451
The ocotillo drops its leaves. That’s the opposite, so the link is contrast.

00:01:49.001 --> 00:01:53.359
For instance gives an example. Similarly means the same.

00:01:53.359 --> 00:01:56.637
Therefore shows a result. Cross them all out.

00:01:57.187 --> 00:02:00.763
However is the only contrast word. Choice B.

00:02:01.963 --> 00:02:03.032
Common traps

00:02:03.432 --> 00:02:04.570
The fancy word

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.652
Sounds smart, wrong logic.

00:02:07.202 --> 00:02:08.653
Reading one sentence

00:02:08.933 --> 00:02:11.475
The logic lives between two sentences.

00:02:12.025 --> 00:02:13.693
Instead vs however

00:02:13.973 --> 00:02:16.773
“Instead” means one thing replaces another.

00:02:17.973 --> 00:02:19.108
Transitions

00:02:19.388 --> 00:02:21.977
Cover. Name. Cross out.

00:02:22.527 --> 00:02:23.107
Spot it

00:02:23.307 --> 00:02:26.318
Blank starts a sentence + 4 linking words

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:27.575
Steps

00:02:27.775 --> 00:02:29.338
1. Cover the choices

00:02:29.618 --> 00:02:33.360
2. Read the sentence before + the one with the blank

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.535
3. Name the link in one word

00:02:35.815 --> 00:02:37.626
4. Cross out the wrong groups

00:02:38.176 --> 00:02:38.901
Remember

00:02:39.101 --> 00:02:42.029
Contrast: however, but, yet, by contrast

00:02:42.309 --> 00:02:45.010
True anyway: nevertheless, still, even so

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.802
Add: moreover, furthermore, in addition

00:02:48.082 --> 00:02:50.999
Result: therefore, thus, as a result

00:02:51.279 --> 00:02:53.611
Example: for example, for instance

00:02:54.161 --> 00:02:54.602
Trap

00:02:54.802 --> 00:02:57.016
The fancy word with the wrong logic

00:02:57.766 --> 00:03:01.184
